AUDIO: 'Hey guys, today we\'re announcing Reframe.&nbsp; Change the aspect ratio of your videos&nbsp; by generating beyond the original frame.&nbsp; Turn horizontal video into vertical,&nbsp; expand 4:3 into widescreen,&nbsp; or zoom out beyond what you already shot. And here\'s the part that matters.&nbsp;'

[00:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Like all Beeble tools, your&nbsp; original shot stays aligned.&nbsp; The performance, the movement, the&nbsp; timing—everything\'s preserved with&nbsp;&nbsp; exactly the same frame count. We built Switch Frame,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'our own model trained specifically for&nbsp; video outpaint to make this possible.&nbsp; Up to 20 seconds, 4K output, and 10-bit color. Here\'s how it works. Upload your clip and choose your aspect ratio.'

[00:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Let\'s take this vertical&nbsp; shot and make it ultra wide. Position, scale, or crop your footage to get the composition you want. I\'m keeping the full height&nbsp; and expanding the scene on both sides.'

[01:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Reframe uses a reference image to guide what it generates beyond your footage. Click autofill to create one automatically, or you can also create a&nbsp; custom reference image and upload your own image.'

